%N A401658 a(0) = 1; a(n) = Sum_{k=1..n} binomial(3*n+k-1,k) * a(n-k).
%F A401658 G.f. A(x) satisfies A(x) = (1-4*x)/(1-x) * (2*A(x*(1-x)^3) - 1).
%F A401658 3|a(n) for n > 0.
%F A401658 a(n) ~ c * n! * n^(2*log(2)/3) * 3^n / log(2)^n, where c = 0.8969923556008423142460752003436047799043853344258944010885765345... - _Vaclav Kotesovec_, Nov 01 2026
%o A401658 (PARI) a_vector(n) = my(v=vector(n+1)); v[1]=1; for(i=1, n, v[i+1]=sum(j=1, i, binomial(3*i+j-1, j)*v[i-j+1])); v;
